<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">Ezra</book>
  <para style="h">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezra</para>
  <para style="mt">Ezra</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Persia lal Kura lal tirh kumin zâwlnei Jeremia hmanga a lo sawi tawh chu Lalpan a thlen kimtîr ta a. He thupêk pe tûr leh a ram zawng zawnga chhiar vek tûra thawn chhuak tûrin Lalpa chuan Kura thinlung chu a chawk tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Persia lal Kura chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Khawvêl ram zawng zawng chu Lalpa , vân Pathian chuan mi pe ta a; tin, Judai rama Jerusalem-ah chuan a in saksak tûrin thu mi pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In zînga ama mite tawh phawt hnênah chuan a Pathian chu awm rawh se; tichuan, Judai rama Jerusalem-ah chuan han chho sela, Lalpa , Israel-hote Pathian in, Jerusalem-a awm chu han sa rawh se; amah chu Pathian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, tu pawh, khawii hmunah pawh an awmnaa la châmbang apiangte chu, an awmna hmuna mite chuan Jerusalem-a awm Pathian in tân anmahni duh thûa an thawh tiam lovin, tangkarua te, rangkachak te, bungrua te, ran tein lo ṭanpui rawh se,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda leh Benjamin chia chhûngkaw puipa deuh deuhte, puithiamte, Levi-hote, Jerusalem-a Lalpa in han sa tûra Pathianin an thinlung a chawh thawh zawng zawngte chu an thawk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, anmahni duh thûa thawh tiam lovin, an vêla mi zawng zawngte chuan tangkaruaa siam bungbêl te, rangkachak te, bungrua te, ran te, thil hlu tak takte an pein, an ṭanpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal Kura pawhin Nebukadnezzaran Lalpa ina bungbêl Jerusalem aṭanga a lâk chhuaha, a pathiante ina a dahte chu a la chhuak leh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />chûng ngei chu Persia lal Kura chuan a vawngtu Mithredatha a lâk chhuahtîr a, a chhiar a, Juda puipa Sesbazzara a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, hêng hi a zât chin chu a ni: rangkachak maihûn sawmthum, tangkaraw maihûn sâng, chemtê sawmhnih leh pakua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />rangkachak no sawmthum, tangkaraw no chi dang zali leh sâwm, bungbêl dang sângte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Rangkachak leh tangkaraw bungbêl zawng zawng chu sângnga leh zali a ni. Salte chu Babulon ata Jerusalem-a an hruai chhoh lai khân Sesbazzaran hêng zawng zawng hi a keng chho va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judai rama mi sala hruai, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzaran Babulon-a a hruai, Jerusalem leh Judai rama kîr leh, mi tin mahni khaw lam ṭheuhva hawte chu hêng hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hêngho hi: Zerubabela te, Jesua te, Nehemia te, Seraia te, Reelaia te, Mordekaia te, Bilsana te, Mispara te, Bigvaia te, Rehuma te, Baana-te ruala kîr an ni. Israel mite patling tam lam chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Parosa thlahte chu 2,172;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sephatia thlahte chu 372;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ara thlahte chu 775;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pahath-moaba thlah zînga Jesua leh Joaba thlahte chu 2,812;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elama thlahte chu 1,254;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zatua thlahte chu 945;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zakaia thlahte chu 760;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bania thlahte chu 642;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bebaia thlahte chu 623;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azgada thlahte chu 1,222;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Adonikama thlahte chu 666;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bigvaia thlahte chu 2,056;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Adina thlahte chu 454;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Atera, Hezekia an tih bawk thlahte chu 98;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bezaia thlahte chu 323;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jora thlahte chu 112;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hasuma thlahte chu 223;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gibara thlahte chu 95;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />an thlahtute aṭanga hêng khuaa lo chêng tawh ṭhînte pawh hetiang hian an kîr leh a: Bethlehem mite chu 123;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Netopha mite 56;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anathoth mite 128;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azmavetha mite chu 42;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kiriath-arima te, Kephira te, Beerotha mite chu 743;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Rama leh Geba mite chu 621;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mikma mite 122;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bethel leh Ai mite 223;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Neboa mite chu 52;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Magbisa mite chu 156;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Elam danga mite chu 1,254;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Harima mite chu 320;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Loda te, Hadida te, Onoa mite chu 725;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jeriko-a mite chu 345;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Senaa mite chu 3,630 an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Puithiamte: Jesua chhûngte zînga Jedaia thlahte chu 973;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Imera thlahte chu 1,052;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pasura thlahte chu 1,247;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Harima thlahte chu 1,017 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Levi chite: Hodavia thlah Jesua leh Kadmiela thlahte chu 74 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hla satute: Asapha thlahte chu 128 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Kawngkhâr vêngtu thlahte: Saluma thlahte, Atera thlahte, Talmona thlahte, Akuba thlahte, Hatita thlahte, Sobaia thlahte chu, an vaia fin khâwmin 139 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nethin-ho: Ziha thlah te, Hasupha thlah te, Tabaotha thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Kerosa thlahte, Siaha thlahte, Padona thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Lebana thlahte, Hagabaha thlahte, Akuba thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hagaba thlahte, Salmaia thlahte, Hanana thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Gidela thlahte, Gahara thlahte, Reaia thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Rezina thlahte, Nekoda thlahte, Gazama thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Uza thlahte, Pasea thlahte, Besaia thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Asnaa thlahte, Meunima thlahte, Nephisima thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Bakbuka thlahte, Hakupha thlahte, Harhura thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Bazlutha thlahte, Mehida thlahte, Harsa thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Barkosa thlahte, Sisera thlahte, Tema thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Nezia thlahte, Hatipha thlahte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Solomona chhiahhlawhte thlahte: Sotaia thlahte, Hasopheretha thlahte, Peruda thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Jaala thlahte, Darkona thlahte, Gidela thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Sephatia thlahte, Hatila thlahte, Pokereth-hazebaima thlahte, Amia thlahte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Nethin mi zawng zawng leh Solomona chhiahhlawhho thlahte chu 392 an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tin, mi 652 Delaia thlahte, Tobia thlahte, Nekoda thlahte, Tel-mela aṭang te, Tel-harsa aṭang te, Kerub aṭang te, Adan aṭang te, Imer aṭangtea lo chhuak chho an awm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />nimahsela, Israel mi an nih leh nih loh an chhui thei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tin, puithiam chite zînga Habaia thlahte, Hakoza thlah te, Gilead mi Barzilaia fanu zînga mi nupuia neia an hming pu nghâl Barzilaia thlahte chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />thlahtu chhuina hming ziaknaah an hming an hmu zo lo va; chuvângin, puithiama pawm an ni ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Ram awptu chuan urim leh thumim hmangtu tûr puithiam a awm hma loh chuan chaw thianghlim an ei a khap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Mipui pung khâwm zawng zawng chu 42,360 an ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />an chhiahhlawh mipa leh hmeichhia 7,337 tiam lovin; tin, hla satu mipa leh hmeichhia 200 an nei bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />An sakawr chu 736 a ni a, an sabengtung chu 245 a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />an sanghâwngsei chu 435 a ni a, an sabengtung tê chi chu 6,720 a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Jerusalem-a Lalpa in an thlen chuan chhûngkaw puipa ṭhenkhatte chuan, Pathian in chu a hmun ngaia din lehna tûrin thilhlan an pe a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />an pêk theih tâwkin in sakna thawhlâwmah chuan rangkachak darik 61,000, tangkarua maneh 5,000 leh puithiam silhfên 100 an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Chutichuan, puithiamte, Levi chite, mi ṭhenkhatte, hla satute, kawngkhâr vêngtute leh Nethin-hote chu an khuaahte an awm ta a, Israel mi zawng zawng chu anmahni khuaah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, thla sarihna a lo thlena, Israel mite chu khuaahte an awm lai chuan, mite chu thukhat vuain Jerusalem khuaah an inkhâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jozadaka fapa Jesua leh a unau puithiamte leh Sealtiela fapa Zerubabela leh a unaute chu an tho va, Pathian mi Mosia dâna chuang angin hâlral thilhlan nân Israel-te Pathian maichâm an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, maichâm chu a hmun ngaiah chuan an din a; chûng rama awmte chu an hlau hle nâ a, maichâmah chuan Lalpa tân hâlral thilhlante an hlân a, zîng lam leh tlai lamah hâlral thilhlan chu an hlân ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An ziak ang khân bâwkte kût chuan an kût a, ni tina tih tûr chin ruat, a bi tâwk thliah ang zêlin ni tina hâlral thilhlan chu an hlân a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />chumi hnuah chuan an ni tin hâlral thilhlan te, thla thar thilhlan te, Lalpa tâna kût ni an ruata an serh apianga thilhlan te; tin, mahni duh thûa thilhlan, Lalpa hnêna lâwm taka hlan ṭhinte chu an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thla sarihna, ni khat aṭangin hâlral thilhlante Lalpa hnênah an hlân ṭan a; nimahsela, Lalpa biak in lungphûm chu an la phûm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lung chhertu leh themthiamte pawh tangka an pe a; tin, Persia lal Kuran a phal dân ang zêlin, sidar thing Lebanon aṭanga tuifinriat, Jopa thlenga rawn la tûrin Zidon mite leh Tura mite chu ei tûrte leh in tûrte leh hriak te an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem-a Pathian in an thlenna kum hnihna, thla hnihnaah chuan Sealtiela fapa Zerubabela te, Jozadaka fapa Jesua te, an unau puithiam leh Levi chi dangte leh sala chhuak Jerusalem-a chho zawng zawng nên chuan an bei ṭan a; Levi chite chu kum sawmhnih mi aṭanga a chung lam mite chu Lalpa in saka hotu atân an ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jesua chu a fapate leh a unaute nên, Kadmiela, a fapate nên, Juda fapate nên chuan Pathian in satute chu an ho tlâng ta a: Henadada fapate, an fapate leh an unau Levi chite nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a satuten Lalpa in lungphûm an han rem chuan puithiamte chu an thuam inbela tawtawrâwt kengin, Levia chi Asapha fapate chu Israel lal Davida tih dân ruat anga Lalpa fak tûrin an dintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ani chu a ṭha si a, a ngilneihna chu Israel mite chungah a awm kumkhua dâwn a ni,” tiin, Lalpa fak leh a hnêna lâwmthu sawiin hlain an inchhâwn a. Lalpa in lungphûm an phûm tâk avânga Lalpa an faknaah chuan mipui zawng zawng chu an au dur dur mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puithiam leh Levi chi leh chhûngkaw puipa tam tak, a in hmasa hmutu putarhote erawh chu an mit hmuhah, hemi in lungphûm an phûm chuan an ṭap vak vak mai a. Tin, mi tam tak chu lâwm avângin an au vak vak bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />chutichuan, mite chuan lâwm avânga au thâwm leh mipui ṭap thâwm chu an thlei thei chuang lo va; mipui chu ring takin an au vak vak mai a, an thâwm chu hla tak aṭangin an hria a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda mi leh Benjamina mite hmêlmate chuan sal chhuakhovin Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian biak in an saksak tih an lo hriat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zerubabela leh an chhûngkaw puipate hnên lamah an va kal a, an hnênah, “Kan sakpui ve ang che u; keini pawhin in zawn ang hian in Pathian chu kan zawng ve a; heta min hruai chhotu Assuria lal Esar-haddona a lal lai aṭang khân a hnênah kan inthawi ṭhîn asin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, Zerubabela leh Jesua leh Israel-te chhûngkaw puipa dangte chuan an hnênah, “Kan Pathian in saksaknaah hian in tel vena kawng rêng rêng a awm lo ve; Persia lal Kura thu min pêk angin keimahniho ngawtin Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian kan saksak dâwn a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, chumi rama mite chuan Juda mite kut chu an tihchauhsak a, an in sa chu an tibuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Persia lal Kura lal chhûng zawng, Persia lal Daria lal thleng hialin an thiltih tumte eng mah lova siam tûrin sawipuitute an ruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Ahasuera lal lai, a lal ṭan tirh laiin Judai ram leh Jerusalem-a awmte hêkna lehkha an phuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Artazerzia lal lai chuan Bislama te, Mithredatha te, Tabeela te leh an ṭhian dangte nên chuan Persia lal Artazerzia chu lehkha an thawn a; an lehkha ziak chu Aramaik ṭawngin Aramaik hawrawpa ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hotu Rehuma leh lehkhaziaktu Simsaia chuan Jerusalem-a mite hêkin Persia lal Artazerzia hetiang lehkha hi an thawn a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lehkha thawntute chu: Hotu Rehuma leh lehkhaziaktu Simsaia leh a ṭhiante - rorêltute leh ram awptute, Persia mi te, Elam rama awm ṭhîn Erek mi te, Babulon mi te leh Susan mi te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mi ropui Asurbanipalan sala a hruai Samaria khuaah leh Euphrates lui thlang lama a awmtîr tâkte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lal Artazerzia chu hetiangin lehkha an thawn a: “Lalber Artazerzia chu i chhiahhlawh Euphrates lui khawthlang lam ram miten chibai kan bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I hnên aṭanga Juda mi lo chhote chu kan hnênah Jerusalem-ah an lo kal a; khaw hel hmang leh sual chu an din ṭha a, a kulh chu an peih tawh a, a lungphûm chu an siam ṭha tawh tih lal chuan lo hre rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hemi khua hi an dina, a kulhte an siam zawh chuan, chhiah te, thil neih man te leh lei mante an chawi duh lo vang a, a tâwpah chuan lalte tân chhiatna a lo ni mai ang tih lalin lo hre rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lal ina chi liak kan nih avângin lal mawi lohna hmuh hi kan tân a fel lo hle si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />chuvângin, i pi leh pute thil chhinchhiah ziakna buah i zawna, chumi ziakna buah chuan i hmuha, hemi khua hi hel hmang khua a nih leh lalte leh an ramte tâna thil hlauhawm tak a niha, an hel kumkhuaa, chumi avâng chuan he khua hi a lo chhia a ni tih i hriat nân lehkha kan thawn a, lal kan hriattîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hemi khua hi an dina, a kulhte an peih vek chuan lui râl lamah rêng rêng chuan chan i neih loh phah ang tih lal kan hriattîr a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, lalber chuan chhânna a thawn a, “Hotu Rehuma te, lehkhaziaktu Simsaia te leh an ṭhian dang Samaria ram leh Euphrates lui thlang lama awmte chibai ka bûk a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kan hnêna in lehkha rawn thawn kha ka hmaah fiah takin an chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, thu ka pe a, an zawng a, he khua hi hmân aṭangin lal chungah an hel ṭhîn a, chutah chuan helna leh buaina a awm ṭhîn tih chu kan hmu chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jerusalem-ah khân lal thiltithei tak tak, lui râl lehlam ram thlenga rorêlte pawh an lo awm tawh a; chhiah te, thil neih man te, lei mante an la ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khâng mite kha chawlhtîr ula, thu ka pêk hma loh chuan khua chu din suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Muang hauh suh u; engah tehlul nge lalte tâna chhiatna thil pawi tak a lo zualkai ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Artazerzia lehkha chu Rehuma leh lehkhaziaktu Simsaia leh an ṭhiante hmaa an chhiar zawh chuan, hmanhmawh takin Jerusalem-a Juda-te hnênah an kal a, thuneihnain an bân luihtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jerusalem-a Pathian in an beih chu an chawlhsan ta a; Persia lal Daria lal kum hnihna thlengin chawlhsan a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan zâwlnei pahnih, Hagaia leh Idova fapa Zekaria-te chuan, Judai ram leh, Jerusalem-a Juda awmte hnênah Israel-te Pathian hmingin thu an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Sealtiela fapa Zerubabela leh Jozadaka fapa Jesua chuan Jerusalem-a Pathian in chu an han bei ṭan leh ta a; tin, an hnênah chuan anmahni ṭanpuiin Pathian zâwlneite chu an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu veleh chuan lui râl ram awptu Tatenaia leh Sethar-bozenaia leh an ṭhiante chu an hnênah chuan an kal a, an hnênah chuan heti hian an sawi a, “He in sa tûr leh he kulh tizo tûr hian tuin nge thu pe che u?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, hetiang hian an hnênah, “Hemi in satute hming hi tute nge ni?” kan ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, an Pathian mit chu Juda upate chungah chuan a fu a, Daria hnênah an thu chu thlena, chhânna a lo thlen hma loh chuan ram awptute chuan an bântîr chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lui râl lehlam awptu Tatenaia leh Sethar-bozenaia leh a ṭhian, lui râla awm Apharsak-hoten Lal Daria hnênah lehkha an thawn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />hetiang hian an ziak a: “Lal Daria hnênah thlamuanna kim awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hei hi lalin lo hre rawh se. Judai ramah Pathian ropui tak in, lung lian tak taka sak leh bang thinga rem, taima tak leh tluang taka an lo beih tawhnaah chuan kan kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, ‘He in sa tûr leh he kulh tizo tûr hian tuin nge thu pe che u?’ tiin an upate kan zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An hotu hmingte chu kan ziak a, kan hriat fiahtîr theih nân che an hmingte pawh chu kan zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan heti hian mi chhâng a, ‘Lei leh vân Pathian chhiahhlawhte kan ni a, kum kha leh chena sak, Israel lal ropui tak pakhat lo sak zawh tawh in chu kan sa ṭha leh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, kan pi leh puten vân Pathian chu thinrim khawpa an tihlungawi loh avângin, Kaldai mi Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara kutah a pe a, ani chuan he in hi a tichhia a, mite chu Babulon lamah a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, Babulon kal Kura lal tirh kumin, Lal Kura chuan he Pathian in hi sak ṭhat leh thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Pathian ina rangkachak leh tangkaruaa siam bungbêl, Jerusalem-a Pathian ina mi Nebukadnezzaran a lâk chhuah, Babulon-a biak ina a lâk luhte chu Lal Kura chuan Babulon biak in ata a la chhuak a, mi pakhat a hming Sesbazzara, ram awptu atâna a siama chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah, “Hêng bungbêl hi la la, kal la, Jerusalem-a biak inah dah la; tin, biak in chu a hmun ngaiah sak ni rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, Sesbazzara ngei chu a kal a, Jerusalem-a biak in lungphûm chu a phûm a; chuta chin chu tûn thleng hian sak a ni ta reng a; nimahsela, la peih loh a la ni reng a,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal ṭha tih zâwng a nih chuan, chutiang chu a ni ngei emaw, Babulon-a lal sum ina mi chu han zawng sela; tin, lal Kura chuan Jerusalem-a biak in sak chungchâng thûah hian a duh dân min han hrilh rawh se,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Daria chuan thu a pe a, Babulon-a an ro dah khâwmna, lehkhabu dahna in chu an zawng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Media rama Akametha khuaa lal inah lehkhabu zial an hmu a, chutah chuan vawn ṭhat atân hetianga ziak hi a awm a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Jerusalem-a Pathian in chungchângah Lal Kura chuan a lal ṭan tirh kumin hetiang hian thu a pe a: ‘An inthawina thilhlanna in chu sak ṭhat leh ni se; a lungphûm pawh nghet taka rem ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A sân lam tawng sawmruk, a zau lam tawng sawmruk, lung lian pui pui tlar thuma rem hnuah thingphêk tlar khat siam tûr a ni a, a sakna hi lal sum aṭanga pêk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Pathian ina rangkachak leh tangkaraw bungbêl Nebukadnezzaran Jerusalem biak in ata a lâk chhuaha Babulon-a a lâkte pawh pêk kîr ni sela, Jerusalem-a biak ina a hmun ngai tê vêka la kîrin, Pathian inah dah tûr a ni,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, lui râl ram awptu Tatenaia leh Sethar-bozenaia leh lui râla awm an ṭhian Apharsak-hote u, intifihlîm rawh u khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />He Pathian biak in an sa leh hi eng mah tih suh u; Juda-te awptu leh Juda upate chuan he Pathian in hi a hmun ngaiah sa rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu bâkah, hêng Juda upaten he Pathian in an sakna tûrah hian ṭanpui tûrin thu ka pe a che u. Hna a bahlah loh nân a sakna tûr pawh Euphrates lui khawthlang bial chhiah, lal sum tûr aṭanga pêk thuai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, vân Pathian tân hâlral thilhlan tûr an mamawh apiang, bâwngpatuai te, berâmpa te, berâmno te, buh chi te, uain te, hriak te, Jerusalem-a puithiamte thu ang zêlin ni tinin pêk ngei ngei tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />chutichuan, vân Pathian chu rimtuia inthawinate an hlân thei ang a, lal leh a fapate chu an dam rei nân an ṭawngṭaisak thei bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu pawh he thu tidanglam apiang, chumi avâng chuan a khanchhuk phawisaka, amah chu chutah chuan khai kâna, a in chu êk dûra siam tûr a ni ang tih thu ka pe bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chuta a hming awmtîrtu Pathian chuan Jerusalem-a Pathian in tihchhiat tuma he thu tidanglam tûra kut lek apiang, lal zawng zawng leh hnam zawng zawngte chu tiboral vek rawh se. Kei Daria hian thu ka pe a ni; zawm nghâl chiah tûr a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, lui râl ram awptu Tatenaia leh Sethar-bozenaia leh a ṭhiante chuan Lal Daria lehkhathawn avângin chutiang chuan an ti ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Hagaia leh Idova fapa Zekaria thusawi avângin Juda upate chuan tluang takin an sa a. Israel-te Pathian thupêk ang leh Persia lal Kura leh Daria leh Artazerzia-te thupêk ang chuan an sa a, an zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, in chu Lal Daria kum ruk a lal kum, Adar thla ni thum nîah an zo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlah, puithiam te, Levi chite leh sal chhuakho dangte chuan chumi Pathian in hlanna chu lâwm takin an hmang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, chumi Pathian in hlannaah chuan bâwngpa za, berâmpa zahnih, berâmno zali an hlân a; tin, Israel zawng zawng tân sual thawi nân Israel hnam zâtin kêlpa sâwm leh pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mosia lehkhabua chuang angin Jerusalem-a Pathian rawngbâwl tûr chuan puithiamte leh Levi chite chu an pâwl ṭheuhvah an awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, sal chhuakhote chuan thla khatna, ni sâwm leh ni li ni chu Kalhlên Kût ni atân an hmang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Puithiamte leh Levi chite chu an inthian ho va, an za chuan an lo thianghlim ta a; chutichuan, Kalhlên Kûtna tûr chu sal chhuakho zawng zawng tân leh an unau puithiamte leh anmahni tân an talh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlah, sal ata lo chhuak lehte leh Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian zawng tûra chu rama Pathian thu âwih lo bawlhhlawhna ata inthiarfihlîma, anniho zâwm zawng zawng tate chuan an ei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />chhang dawidim telh loh kût chu lâwm takin ni sarih an hmang a: Lalpa chuan anni chu a tihlim a, Pathian, Israel-te Pathian in saknaa an kutte tihchaksak tûrin Assuria lal rilru chu an lamah a thlêktîr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chûng thil hnuah chuan Persia lal Artazerzia lal laiin Ezra chu Babulon aṭangin a chho va; chu mi chu Seraia fa a ni a, chu mi chu Azaria fa a ni a, chu mi chu Hilkia fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />chu mi chu Saluma fa a ni a, chu mi chu Zadoka fa a ni a, chu mi chu Ahituba fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chu mi chu Amaria fa a ni a, chu mi chu Azaria fa a ni a, chu mi chu Meraiotha fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />chu mi chu Zerahia fa a ni a, chu mi chu Uzia fa a ni a, chu mi chu Bukia fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />chu mi chu Abisua fa a ni a, chu mi chu Phinehasa fa a ni a, chu mi chu Eleazara fa a ni a, chu mi chu puithiam lal Arona fa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ezra chu lehkhaziaktu, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian pêk Mosia dân thiam tak a ni a. Lalpa a Pathianin a duhsakna avângin lal chuan a dîl zawng zawng chu a pe zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Lal Artazerzia kum sarih a lal kum chuan Israela thlah ṭhenkhatte, puithiam ṭhenkhatte, Levi chi ṭhenkhatte, hla satute, kawngkhâr vêngtute, temple enkawltute chu Jerusalem-ah an chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, lal chu kum sarih a lal kum, thla nganaah ani chu Jerusalem-ah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thla khatna, ni khat nîah Babulon aṭangin a chhuak a, a Pathianin amah chu vêng zêlin thla ngana, ni khat nîah Jerusalem a thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ezra chuan Lalpa dân chu hriaa zâwm tûr leh Israel-hote chu thuruatte leh rorêlte zirtîr tûrin a thinlung a siam tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, hei hi Lal Artazerzian puithiam Ezra, lehkhaziaktu, Lalpa thupêk thu leh Israel mite tâna a thuruatte zirtu hnêna a lehkhathawn thu chu a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalte lal Artazerzian puithiam Ezra, vân Pathian dân ziaktu chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka ram chhûnga Israel mi zawng zawng leh an puithiamte leh Levi chite, Jerusalem-a mahni duh thûa kal châkna nei apiangte chu, i hnêna kal tûrin thu ka pe e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I kawl Pathian dân ang zêla Judai ram leh Jerusalem chanchin ngai chiang tûr leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jerusalem-a awm Israel-te Pathian, mahni duh thûa lal leh a rorêltuten an pêk, tangkarua leh rangkachak keng tûra lal leh a rorêltu pasarihin an tirh che i ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Babulon ram zawng zawnga i hmuh zât apiang tangkarua leh rangkachak, mahni duh thûa mipuite leh puithiamten an pêk, Jerusalem-a an Pathian in atâna lâwm taka an pêkte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />chutichuan, hêng tangka hian bâwngpa te, berâmpa te, berâmno te, ei tûr leh in tûr thilhlan tûr nên i lei nghâl ang a; tin, Jerusalem-a in Pathian ina maichâmah chuan i hlân dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, tangkarua leh rangkachak hman bângte chu in Pathian remtih zâwng âwmin nang leh i unauten ṭha in tih ang angin ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, i Pathian in rawngbâwl nâna bungbêl an pêk che chu Jerusalem-a Pathian hnênah chuan hlân ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, i Pathian in tâna mamawh danga hman ṭûlna a awm phawt chuan lal sum ina mi hmang ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kei, lal Artazerzia ngeiin lui râla sum enkawltu zawng zawngte chu - Puithiam Ezra, vân Pathian dân ziaktuin a dîl apiang che u chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tangkarua chu talent za, buh chu bûk za, uain chu bath za, hriak chu bath za, chi chu eng zât tih pawh awm chuang lovin pe nghâl ang che u, tiin thu ka pe e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vân Pathianin thu a pêk apiang chu, chutiang chiahin vân Pathian in atân tih ni rawh se; thinurna chu lal leh a fate ram chungah hian engah tehlul nge a awm ang ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, puithiamte, Levi chite, hla satute, kawngkhâr vêngtute, Nethin-hote, he Pathian ina rawngbâwltute hi chhiah te, thil neih man te, lei man te chu chawitîr loh tûr a nih kan hriattîr bawk a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, nang Ezra, i kawl Pathianin finna a pêk che angin lui râla awmho zawng zawngte ro an rêlsak theih nân hotute leh rorêltute, i Pathian dân hre mite ruat la, hre lote chu zirtîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, tu pawh i Pathian dân leh lal dân zâwm lo apiang chu thi khawpin emaw, ram ata hnawh chhuahin emaw, an bungrua lâksakin emaw, tân ina tântîrin emaw an chungah rorêlna a awm nghâl tûr a ni, a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem-a Lalpa in timawi tûra lal chu hetiang rilru puttîrtu leh, lal leh a rorêltu hma leh lal mi lian lâr tak takho hmaa ka chunga khawngaihna zâmtîrtu Lalpa , kan pi leh pute Pathian chu fakin awm rawh se. Tin, Lalpa ka Pathianin mi khawngaih a, mi tichak a; tichuan, ka hnêna han kal ve tûrin Israel zînga mi hotu deuh deuhte ka thlang khâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hêngte hi Lal Artazerzia lal laia Babulon ram ata ka hnêna kal chhoho, chhûngkaw puipa leh an thlahte hming chu a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Phinehasa thlahte zîngah Gersoma; Ithamara thlahte zîngah Daniela; Davida thlahte zîngah Hatusa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sekania thlahte, Parosa thlahte zîngah Zekaria, mipa za leh sawmnga nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pahath-moaba thlahte zîngah Zerahia fa Eliehoenaia, mipa zahnih nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sekania thlahte zîngah Jahaziela fa, mipa zathum nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Adina thlahte zîngah Jonathana fa Ebeda, mipa sawmnga nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elama thlahte zîngah Athalia fa Jesaia, mipa sawmsarih nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sephatia thlahte zîngah Mikaela fa Zebadia, mipa sawmriat nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joaba thlahte zîngah Jehiela fa Obadia, mipa zahnih leh sâwm leh pariat nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Selomitha thlahte zîngah Josiphia fa, mipa za leh sawmruk nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tin, Bebaia thlahte zîngah Bebaia fa Zekaria, mipa sawmhnih leh pariat nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tin, Azgada thlahte zîngah Hakatana fa Johanana, mipa za leh sâwm nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Adonikama thlahte zîngah (a hnuhnûng ber an ni a) an hming chu hêng hi a ni - Elipheleta te, Jeuela te, Semaia te, mipa sawmruk nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bigvaia thlahte zînga Uthaia leh Zabuda, mipa sawmsarih nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahava lama luang lui kamah chuan ka awm khâwmtîr a; chutah chuan ni thum kan awm a. Tin, mipuite leh puithiamte chu ka han en vêl a, Levia thlahte rêng rêng ka hmu ve ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, puipa deuh deuh, Eliezera te, Ariela te, Semaia te, Elnathana te, Jariba te, Elnathana te, Nathana te, Zekaria te, Mesulama te ka chah a; zirtîrtu Joiariba leh Elnathana-te pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Kasiphia hmuna hotu Idova hnênah ka tîr a, kan Pathian ina rawngbâwltu tûr rawn hruai tûrin Kasiphia hmuna Idova leh a unaute Nethin-ho hnêna an han sawi tûr ka hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Pathian min khawngaihna avângin Issekela, Mahlia thlahte zîngah; Israela fapa, chu mi fapa Levia; Serebia, a fate leh a unau sâwm leh pariatte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hasabia, Meraria thlahte zîngah Jesaia, a unaute leh an fate sawmhnih nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nethin-ho, Davida leh an mi lianten Levi chite rawngbâwl tûra an pêkte zînga mi Nethin-ho zahnih leh sawmhnihte nên min hruaisak a. An zaa hming ziak ṭheuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, kan Pathian hmaa kan intihtlâwma, a hnêna keini leh kan fate leh kan bungrua zawng zawngte nêna tluang taka kal theihna dîl tûrin, Ahava luiah chuan chaw nghei thu ka puang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Kan Pathian duhsakna chu amah zawngtute zawng zawng chungah an ṭhatna tûrin a awm zêl a; a thiltihtheihna leh a thinurna erawh chu amah hawisante chungah a awm zêl ṭhîn,” tia lal hnêna kan lo sawi tawh avângin, kalkawnga kan hmêlmate laka min ṭanpui tûra sipai leh sakawr chung chuang mite lal dîl chu zahthlâk ka ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, chaw kan nghei a, chumi chu kan Pathian kan dîl chiam a; kan dîlna chu min ngaihthlâksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, puithiam tûpa deuh deuhte zînga mi sâwm leh pahnih, Serebia leh Hasabia leh an unaute zînga mi sâwm ka tihrang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tin, lal leh a rorêltute leh a mi liante leh chuta awm Israel-te zawng zawngin kan Pathian in atân an thilhlan, tangkarua te, rangkachak te, bungbêlte chu ka bûk a, ka hlân a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ka bûka an kuta ka hlan chu tangkaraw talent zaruk leh sawmnga; tangkaraw bungbêl talent za; rangkachak talent za;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />rangkachak berhbu sawmhnih, darik sângkhat ṭheuh; dâr tle mi mawi tak, rangkachak ang maia hlû bungbêl pahnih a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “ Lalpa tâna tihthianghlim in ni a, bungbêlte pawh tihthianghlim a ni; tangkarua leh rangkachakte hi Lalpa , in pi leh pute Pathian tâna mahni duh thûa hlan vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Puithiam tûpa deuh deuhte leh Levi chite leh Israel mite chhûngkaw puipa hmaa Jerusalem-a Lalpa ina pindana in bûk hma loh chuan vêng ula, kawl rawh u,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutichuan, puithiamte leh Levi chite chuan Jerusalem-a kan Pathian ina ken tûrin, tangkarua leh rangkachak leh bungbêl bûkte chu an la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jerusalem-a kal tûrin thla khatna, ni sâwm leh ni hnih nîah Ahava lui aṭang chuan kan chhuak ta a; tin, kan Pathianin min khawngaih a, hmêlma lak ata leh kawng laka châng rutute lak ata chu min humhim zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem chu kan han thleng a, chutah chuan ni thum kan hahchâwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, a ni li ni chuan tangkarua te, rangkachak te, bungbêlte chu kan Pathian inah bûkin puithiam Uria fapa Meremotha kutah kan hlân a; tin, a hnênah chuan Phinehasa fapa Eleazara a awm a; tin, an hnênah chuan Levi chi Jesua fapa, Jozabada leh Binuia fapa Noadia te an awm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />chhiar vek leh bûk vek a ni a. A bûk zât chu chumi lai la la chuan an ziak vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Sal chhuakhote chuan Israel-te Pathian hnênah hâlral thilhlan an hlân a, Israel zawng zawng pualah bâwngpa sâwm leh pahnih, berâmpa sawmkua leh paruk, berâmno sawmsarih leh pasarih; sual thawi nân kêlpa sâwm leh pahnih. Hêng zawng zawng hi Lalpa hnêna hâlral thilhlan vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, lal thuruatte chu lal upate leh lui râl ram awptute chu an hrilh a; tin, anni chuan mipuite chu ṭanpuiin Pathian in sak chu an chhunzawmpui ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chûng thiltih zawh chuan mi liante chuan, “Israel mite leh puithiamte leh Levi chite chu he ram mite lakah hian inthiarfihlîm chuang lovin, Kanaan-ho te, Hit-ho te, Periz-ho te, Jebus-ho te, Amon-ho te, Moab-ho te, Aigupta-ho te, Amor-hote thiltih tenawm tak an tih ang zêl an ti ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An fanute chu anmahni leh an fapaten an nei ta mai a; chutichuan, chi thianghlim chu he ram mite nên hian an chawhpawlh a. A ni, mi liante leh rorêltute chu he bawhchhiatna thûah hian a tûpa berte an ni,” tiin mi rawn hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chu thil chu ka hriat chuan ka kawr leh ka puan ka pawt thlêr a, ka sam leh ka khabe hmul ka pawt thla a, a ngaihna hre lovin ka ṭhu ta ngawih ngawih mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, sal chhuakho bawhchhiatna avânga Israel-te Pathian thûa khûr apiangte chu ka hnênah an lo kal khâwm a; tlai lam inthawi hun thlengin a ngaihna hre lovin ka ṭhu ta ngawih ngawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, tlai lam inthawi hun chuan ka lungngaihna ata ka kawr leh ka puan thlêr chung chuan ka tho va; tin, ka ṭhingṭhi a, Lalpa ka Pathian lamah ka bân ka phar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, “Aw ka Pathian, i lam lo hawi hi ka zak a, ka hmai te a sen ṭâwn ṭâwn a ni, ka Pathian; kan bawhchhiatnate chu min chîm pil khawpin a pung a, kan thiam lohna chuan vân a tawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kan pi leh pute chenin tûn thleng hian kan thiam lo let dêr a ni; kan bawhchhiatna avângin kan lalte, kan puithiamte nên ram dang lal man te, khandaiha thah te, sala tân te, rawk te, mualphonate kan tâwk a, vawiina kan awm ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, tûnah hian kan Pathian chuan kan mitte a tihvâra, sala kan awm min tihharha, a hmun thianghlimah chuan min awm ngheh tlattîrna tûrin a la awm chhunte chu min chhuahtîrin, Lalpa kan Pathian khawngaihna kan dawng rih mai a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chhiah khua zawng kan ni ngei mai a; nimahsela, kan Pathian chuan chhiah khua kan nih chhûng pawhin min thlahthlam chuang lo va, min tiharh tûr leh kan Pathian in din tûr leh a chhe hnu chei tûr leh Judai ram leh Jerusalem-a kulh nei tûrin, Persia lalte mit hmuhah chuan kan chungah khawngaihna a zâm zautîr ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw kan Pathian, tûnah hian eng nge kan sawi tâk ang? I thupêkte chu kan hawisan ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh zâwlneite hmanga, ‘In va kalna tûr, in ram luah tûr chu a rama mi awmte bawlhhlawhna avângin a bawlhhlawh a, kil tin kil tang an tenawmnain a titenawm vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, in fanute chu an fapate neihtîr suh ula, an fanute chu in fapate neihtîr hek suh ula, an thawvenna leh an hmuingîlna rêng rêng zawnsak hek suh ula, in lo chaka, chumi rama thil ṭha chu in eia, kumkhuaa in fate in inrochun theih nân,’ tia thu i pêkte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, kan thil tihsual avâng leh kan thiam lohna nasa tak avânga kan chunga hetiang thil a lo awma, nang kan Pathianin kan bawhchhiatnain a phu aia nêpa min hrem hnua la awm cheute min la nei tih hre reng chung siin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />i thupêkte chu kan bawhchhe lehin, hêng thil tenawm titute nên hian kan la inneih pawlh cheu dâwn em ni? A bâk rêng awm lo leh pumpelh rêng pawh awm lova min tiboral khawpin kan chungah i thinur hial dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, nang chu i fel a, vawiinah hian tlêm zawng min la zuah hi. Ngai teh, thiam lovin i hmaah kan awm a, hemi avâng hian tu mah i hmaa ding thei rêng rêng kan awm lo a ni,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Pathian in lam hawia bawkkhupa ṭap chunga Ezra a ṭawngṭaia, thupha a chawi lai chuan a hnênah Israel mi, mi tam tak, a hmei a pain naupangte nên an lo kal khâwm chiam a; mipuite chu nasa takin an ṭap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Elama thlah zînga mi Jehiela fapa Sekania chuan Ezra hnênah, “Kan Pathian chungah chuan thil chu kan tisual ta ngei mai a, hemi rama hnam dang hmeichhiate chu nupuiah kan nei a; nimahsela, Israel mite tân hemi chungchâng thûah hian beiseina a la awm cheu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, hawh u, ka pu leh kan Pathian thupêka khûr apiangte remruat ang zêlin, chûng mipuite zawng zawng leh an laka piang apiangte chu ṭhen tûrin kan Pathian hnênah thu i thlung teh ang u; tin, chu chu dân ang zêla tih ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tho rawh khai, hemi hi i puala lum a ni a; keini pawh i lama ṭang kan ni a; huai takin awm la, ti mai rawh,” tiin a tihpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Ezra chu a tho va, puithiam tûpa deuh deuhte leh Levi chite leh Israel mi zawng zawngte chu, chu thu anga ti tûr chuan chhia a chhamtîr a. Chutichuan, chhia chu an chham ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Ezra chu Pathian in lam a hawi chu a tho va, Eliasiba fapa Jehohanana pindanah a lût a; tin, chutah chuan zankhuain sal chhuakte thil tihsual avânga lungngaiin eng mah a eiin a in lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Judai ram zawng zawng leh Jerusalem-a sal chhuakho zawng zawng hnênah chuan Jerusalem-a inkhâwm veka, tu pawh an mi liante leh an upate thupêk anga ni thum chhûnga lo kal lo apiangte chu an bungrua zawng zawng hrênsak veka, anmahni pawh chu sal chhuakho zîng ata hnawh chhuah tûr a ni ang, tih thu an puang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda mi leh Benjamin mite chu chumi ni thum chhûng chuan Jerusalem-ah an inkhâwm vek a. Chu chu thla kuana, ni sawmhnih ni a ni a; Pathian in kawt zau laiah chuan mipui zawng zawng chu an ṭhu a, chûng thu avâng leh ruahpui nasa tak a sûr avâng chuan an khûr an khûr mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Ezra chu a ding a, an hnênah, “Thil in lo tisual ta a, Israel mite thiam lohna belhchhahin hnam dang hmeichhiate nupuiah in nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa , in pi leh pute Pathian hnênah chuan thupha chawi ula, a lâwm zâwng ti tawh rawh u khai; tin, he rama hnam dang leh an hmeichhiate lak ata hi inthiarfihlîm rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipui zawng zawngte chuan an chhâng a, ring takin, “Kan chungchâng thu chu i sawi ang tak chuan kan ti ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, mi kan tam si a; ruah sûr hun lai a lo ni bawk si a, pâwnah hian kan ding reng thei lo ve. Tin, ni hnih khat thila han tih mai mi a ni bawk hek lo, hemi thûah hian kan lo bawhchhe nasa hle si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipui zawng zawng aiah kan mi liante ruat ni sela, kan chunga Pathian thinurna nasa tak hi a kiana, hemi thu hi kan tihfel hma loh chuan, kan khuaa hnam dang hmeichhe neitute zawng zawng chu khaw tina an upate leh rorêltute nên an lo kal hun bi ruatah lo kal zêl rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asahela fapa Jonathana leh Tikva fapa Jahzeia-te chauhvin hemi thu hi an kalh a; tin, Levi chi Mesulama leh Sabethaian an ṭanpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, sal chhuakho chuan chutiang chuan an ti ta a. Tin, puithiam Ezra chuan chhûngkaw puipate zînga mi an hminghmerh vekin a ruat a; tin, thla sâwmna, ni khat nîah chumi thu chu ngaihtuahin an inkhâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, thla khatna, ni khat nîah hnam dang hmeichhe neitute chu an tifel ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, puithiam fate zînga hnam dang hmeichhia nupuia lo nei an hriatte chu: Jesua leh a unaute zîngah Jozadaka fapa leh a unau - Maaseia te, Eliezera te, Jariba te, Gedalia te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anni chuan an nupuite ṭhen tûrin thu an thlung a; tin, an thiam loh avângin an thiam lohna chu berâm rual zînga mi berâmpa pakhatin an thawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Imera thlahte zîngah Hanania leh Zebadia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Harima thlahte zîngah Maaseia te, Elija te, Semaia te, Jehiela te, Uzia te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pasura thlahte zîngah Elioenaia te, Maaseia te, Ismaela te, Nethanela te, Jozabada te, Elasa te an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Levi chite zîngah Jozabada te, Simeia te, Kelaia te (Kelita an ti bawk ṭhîn), Pethahia te, Juda te, Eliezera te an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, hla satute zîngah Eliasiba a ni a; kawngkhâr vêngtute zîngah Saluma te, Telema te, Uria te an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Israel-hote zîngah Parosa thlaha mi Ramia te, Izia te, Malkija te, Mijamina te, Eleazera te, Malkija te, Benaia te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Elama thlaha mi Matania te, Zekaria te, Jehiela te, Abdia te, Jeremotha te, Elija te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zatua thlaha mi Elioenaia te, Eliasiba te, Matania te, Jeremotha te, Zabada te, Aziza te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bebaia thlaha mi Jehohanana te, Hanania te, Zabaia te, Athlaia te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bania thlaha mi Mesulama te, Maluka te, Adaia te, Jasuba te, Seala te, Jeremotha te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pahath-moaba thlaha mi Adna te, Kelala te, Benaia te, Maaseia te, Matania te, Bezalela te, Binuia te, Manasea te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Harima thlaha mi Eliezera te, Isija te, Malkija te, Semaia te, Simeona te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Benjamina te, Maluka te, Semaria te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hasuma thlaha mi Matenaia te, Matata te, Zabada te, Elipheleta te, Jeremaia te, Manasea te, Simeia te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bania thlaha mi Ma-adaia te, Amrama te, Uela te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Benaia te, Bedeia te, Keluhia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Vania te, Meremotha te, Eliasiba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Matania te, Matenaia te, Jaasua te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Bania te, Binuia te, Simeia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Selemia te, Nathana te, Adaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Maknadebaia te, Sasaia te, Saraia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Azarela te, Selemia te, Semaria te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Saluma te, Amaria te, Josefa te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Neboa thlaha mi Jeiela te, Matithia te, Zabada te, Zebina te, Idova te, Joela te, Benaia te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hêng zawng zawng hian hnam dang nupuiah an nei a; tin, ṭhenkhat chuan chûng an nupuite lakah chuan fate an nei a.
  </para>
</usx>
